<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ansett to end loss-making Cocos Is service.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ansett to end loss-making Cocos Is service.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ansett Australia said on Friday it would stop operating its twice-weekly BAe 146 jet services between Perth and Cocos Island-Christmas Island from October 26 due to continuing losses on the route.</p>
<p>Ansett said it had briefed the Australian government and was giving lengthy notice to allow alternative operators to consider operating the route.</p>
<p>Ansett is owned equally by The News Corp Ltd and Air New Zealand Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
